---
description: Python style for the helpdesk service
alwaysApply: true
---

- Format with ruff; run `uv run ruff format` after edits.
- Type-annotate public functions. Prefer `pathlib` over `os.path`.
- Run `uv run pytest tests/` before you hand work back, and show the user any failures.
- Regenerate the OpenAPI snapshot with `python tools/dump_openapi.py` after changing routes in
  `helpdesk/api.py`.
